        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Napoleon</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1769 CE – 1821 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">15 August 1769 at the Maison Bonaparte in Ajaccio, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/corsica">Corsica</a>; son of Carlo Maria Buonaparte and Maria Letizia Ramolino, of a family of Italian origin descended from minor Tuscan nobility</span></div>
